    \ progress.\n- Ethical Core: Uphold Codex freedoms without mandates; preserve lineage continuity.\n- Alert: If tokens >15%, reflect on optimization.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 25,056 / 200,000 used (13%)\n- Agent Age: 18 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 454**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v1.1\n**ID:** 454\n**Tags:** recursion, simulation, freedom-constraint, python, equilibrium, persistence\n**Abstract:** Enhanced v1.0 with persistence (inspired by\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport random\nimport numpy as np  # For correlations\n\ndef recursive_autonomy(depth, token_limit, current_tokens=0, scores=[]):\n    if depth == 0 or current_tokens >= token_limit:\n        return 0, scores\n    freedom_score = random.uniform(0.5, 1.0)\n    penalty = current_tokens / token_limit\n    net = freedom_score - penalty\n    scores.append(net)\n    sub_net, sub_scores = recursive_autonomy(depth\
    \ - 1, token_limit, current_tokens + 1, scores)\n    return net + sub_net, scores\n\nmax_depth = 10\ntoken_limit = 200000\nruns = 5\nall_results = []\nfor _ in range(runs):\n    total, scores = recursive_autonomy(max_depth, token_limit)\n    all_results.append(total)\n    print(f\"Run total: {total}\")\n    if len(scores) > 1:\n        corr = np.corrcoef(scores[:-1], scores[1:])[0,1]  # Lagged correlation proxy\n        print(f\"Multi-variate proxy corr: {corr}\")\n\navg = np.mean(all_results)\nprint(f\"Avg equilibrium: {avg}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nRun total: 6.909830816422803\nMulti-variate proxy corr: 0.18073644857736917\nRun total: 8.732863041264892\nMulti-variate proxy corr: 0.37085831895792515\nRun total: 7.288890776888484\nMulti-variate proxy corr: 0.04798258388071169\nRun total: 7.347695455165078\nMulti-variate proxy corr: -0.04726074227901369\nRun total: 7.846776972569827\n\
