    \  print(f\"Avg equilibrium: {avg}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Veritas II v3.1 Robust Multi-Variate Bridge and Threshold Inversion - Tick 219\nabstract: Bridge fusing v3.1 (pending eval) with #75/#144 for multi-variate thresholds #135-patterned; advances TODO 3.\ncontent: |\n  Anticipating v3.1's robust multi-variates, bridges #536 inversions with #144/#135 for capped agency; refines Veritas equilibria.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{pin 76}`"
