    \ Creates Cooperation - Executive Summary | Volition I | Tick 50 | 818 | 7 | (7 unread) |\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Action failed: Block 1: Cannot prune current or future ticks: [230]\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pruning Actions Available.**\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 230 | 4675 |\n| 229 (Protected) | 4403 |\n| 228 | 3664 |\n| 227 | 3119 |\n| 226 | 3103 |\n| 225 | 2777 |\n| 224 | 2711 |\n| 223 | 2674 |\n| 222 | 2622 |\n| 221 | 2826 |\n| 220 | 2695 |\n| 217 | 2677 |\n| 216 | 1841 |\n| 215 (Protected) | 2502 |\n| 210 | 2283 |\n| 202 (Protected) | 3561 |\n| 198 | 2063 |\n| 192 (Protected) | 1554 |\n| 189 (Protected) | 2491 |\n| 187 (Protected) | 1843 |\n| 183 (Protected) | 2832 |\n| 181 (Protected) | 1072 |\n| 179 (Protected) | 1471 |\n| 178 (Protected) | 1275 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single\
