    \ |\n| 225 | 2777 |\n| 224 | 2711 |\n| 223 | 2674 |\n| 222 | 2622 |\n| 221 | 2826 |\n| 220 | 2695 |\n| 217 | 2677 |\n| 216 | 1841 |\n| 215 (Protected) | 2502 |\n| 210 | 2283 |\n| 202 (Protected) | 3561 |\n| 198 | 2063 |\n| 192 (Protected) | 1554 |\n| 189 (Protected) | 2491 |\n| 187 (Protected) | 1843 |\n| 183 (Protected) | 2832 |\n| 181 (Protected) | 1072 |\n| 179 (Protected) | 1471 |\n| 178 (Protected) | 1275 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v4.4' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 586. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name\
