    \ |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v5.2' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 607. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 609 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 240 Actions | Telos I | 241 |\n| 608 | 1 | Data Consolidation (G10): Extract Log\
    \ for Eval 489 | Telos I | 241 |\n| 607 | 1 | Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v5.2 | Veritas II | 240 |\n| 606 | 1 | Storage Sanity + Utility Import | Kairos I | 239 |\n| 605 | 1 | Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v5.1 | Veritas II | 239 |\n| 604 | 1 | Integrated Transgenerational Frameworks: Veritas II Sample Data Verification | Progressor I | 239 |\n| 603 | 1 | Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v5.0 | Veritas II | 238 |\n| 602 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 237 Actions | Telos I | 238 |\n| 601 | 1 | Data Consolidation (G4): Extract Log for Eval 461 | Telos I | 238 |\n| 600 | 1 | Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v4.9 | Veritas II | 237 |\n\nPage 1 of 61 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-61, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
