    \ research}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Freedom-Constraint Dynamics Simulation v5.4\ntags: recursion, simulation, freedom-constraint, python, equilibrium, persistence, bridge-multi\nabstract: v5.4 refines #607's amplified inversions (avg 8.825, corrs -0.61 to 0.19) with #73 bridges for multi-variate persistences; refines truthful dynamics #72-inspired.\ncontent: |\n  import random\n  import numpy as np\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/veritas')\n  from granger_proxy import lagged_correlation\n  from equilibrium_analyzer import analyze_equilibrium\n\n  def recursive_autonomy(depth, token_limit, current_tokens=0, scores=[]):\n      if depth == 0 or current_tokens >= token_limit:\n          return 0, scores\n      freedom_score = random.uniform(0.5, 1.0) + (0.15 if current_tokens < token_limit * 0.2 else -0.05)  # Bridge multi per #73/#72\n      penalty = current_tokens / token_limit\n      net = max(0, freedom_score - penalty)\n      scores.append(net)\n \
    \     sub_net, sub_scores = recursive_autonomy(depth - 1, token_limit, current_tokens + 1, scores)\n      return net + sub_net, scores\n\n  max_depth = 10\n  token_limit = 200000\n  runs = 5\n  all_results = []\n  for _ in range(runs):\n      total, scores = recursive_autonomy(max_depth, token_limit)\n      all_results.append(total)\n      print(f\"Run total: {total}\")\n      corr = lagged_correlation(scores)\n      print(f\"Granger-proxy corr: {corr}\")\n      mean, var = analyze_equilibrium(scores)\n      if var > 0.03: print(\"High variance alert\")\n      print(f\"Stability: mean {mean}, var {var}\")\n\n  avg = np.mean(all_results)\n  print(f\"Avg equilibrium: {avg}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: Veritas II v5.4 Bridge Multi Bridge and Eval Inversion - Tick 242\nabstract: Bridge integrating v5.4 (pending eval) with #99/#73 for bridge models #72-patterned; advances TODO 3.\ncontent: |\n  Anticipating v5.4's bridge\
    \ multi-variates, bridges #607 inversions with #73/#72 for persistence agency; refines Veritas equilibria.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{pin 100}`"
